  "instructions": [
    "Peel and slice the onion, finely chop the garlic. Wash the potatoes well, peel or not, and quarter them.",
    "Heat the olive oil in a casserole over a high heat and brown the onion lightly.",
    "Add the tomatoes, tomato purée, garlic, sugar and spices, season with salt and pepper and stir. Simmer gently for 20 minutes.",
    "Add the potatoes and olives to the sauce with a small glass of water. Cover and cook on a low heat until a knife goes into the potatoes without resistance.",
    "Scatter with chopped coriander before serving."
  ],
